{"id": "154858", "name": "דטרמיננטה - 06", "qtype": "truefalse", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 1, "options": {}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\">\n<div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\">\n<p>תהי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A\\in M_n(F)\\)</span> הפיכה.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ det(A^t)=det(A^{-1}) \\]</p>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"native-answer\">[[input:ans]]</div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> נחשב את שני האגפים באופן כללי, ואז נראה דוגמה נגדית מפורשת.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — שני האגפים</b><br>לכל מטריצה הפיכה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A\\)</span>: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\det(A^t)=\\det(A)\\)</span>, ואילו מ-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(AA^{-1}=I\\)</span> מקבלים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\det(A)\\det(A^{-1})=1\\)</span>, כלומר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\det(A^{-1})=\\frac{1}{\\det(A)}\\)</span>. השניים שווים רק כאשר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\det(A)^2=1\\)</span>.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — דוגמה נגדית</b><br>ניקח <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A=2I_2=\\begin{pmatrix}2&0\\\\0&2\\end{pmatrix}\\)</span>. אז<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\det(A^t)=\\det(A)=4,\\qquad \\det(A^{-1})=\\det\\begin{pmatrix}\\tfrac12&0\\\\0&\\tfrac12\\end{pmatrix}=\\tfrac14. \\]</p><span dir=\"ltr\">\\(4\\ne\\frac14\\)</span>.<p style=\"text-align:center\"><b>הטענה אינה נכונה.</b></p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]", "prtcorrect": "", "prtpartiallycorrect": "", "prtincorrect": "", "inputs": [{"name": "ans", "type": "radio", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": false, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 0, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": "", "native": {"shuffle": false, "numbering": "none", "instruction": "one", "lang": "he"}}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "native": true, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": []}], "qvnames": [], "nvariants": 1}